+---
+-- Shows markers for other players on the map window and the minimap, replacing the previous markers.
+-- They are not saved and can not be edited. Pass an empty list to remove them.
+-- @function [parent=#ui] setPlayerMarkers
+-- @param #list<#table> markers Each entry is a table `{ cell = "", x = 0, y = 0, name = "" }`: `cell` is empty for the exterior or
+-- the name of an interior cell, `x` and `y` are world coordinates, `name` is shown as the tooltip.
+
 ---
 -- Shows given message at the bottom of the screen.
 -- @function [parent=#ui] showMessage
